{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"thomas-roberts","name":"Thomas Roberts","birthDate":"1972-10-05","birthPlace":"Towson, Maryland, USA","bio":"Thomas Albert Roberts (born October 5, 1972) is an American television journalist who served as a news anchor for MSNBC, a cable-news channel. He ended his seven-year stint anchoring MSNBC Live, the daytime news platform of NBC News, on weekends from 5-7pm ET. Before that he was anchor of Way Too Early and a contributor to Morning Joe. He was also an NBC News correspondent and a fill-in anchor on Today and NBC Nightly News. On November 18, 2017, it was announced that Roberts had decided to leave MSNBC for other endeavors. On August 14, 2020, it was announced that Roberts will be the host of season four of DailyMailTV.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:09:10+00:00","tmdbId":1234512,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1234512","credits":[{"id":"iron-man-3","title":"Iron Man 3","character":"Thomas Roberts"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/thomas-roberts.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Thunder Force","year":2021,"character":"Newscaster #2","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3mKMWP5OokB7QpcOMA1yl8BXFAF.jpg"},{"name":"The Boys","year":2019,"character":"Thomas Roberts","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/in1R2dDc421JxsoRWaIIAqVI2KE.jpg"},{"name":"Graves","year":2016,"character":"Thomas Roberts","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pfWl1kOR6Y0CC7o1RDOaTYVAVoP.jpg"},{"name":"Pink Moon","year":2015,"character":"Himself","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/u7PDyPhKdnTKoFoHto2Q7gsuq21.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Man 3","year":2013,"character":"Thomas Roberts","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qhPtAc1TKbMPqNvcdXSOn9Bn7hZ.jpg"},{"name":"The Avengers","year":2012,"character":"Thomas Roberts","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/RYMX2wcKCBAr24UyPD7xwmjaTn.jpg"},{"name":"Advocate On-